></ruby>にしている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这部小说讲述了南北战争。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">事件</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じけん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">事件；事故；案件；情节；麻烦；丑闻</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221665\">この<ruby>事件<rp>(</rp><rt>じけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>貸<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请帮助这件事。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">事故</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じこ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">事故；意外；麻烦；情况；原因；缘由</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209899\">その<ruby>事故<rp>(</rp><rt>じこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>について<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>質問<rp>(</rp><rt>しつもん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我问他关于事故。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">自己</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じこ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">自己；自身</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"105234\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>自己<rp>(</rp><rt>じこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>没却<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼっきゃく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他不是一个破坏自己的人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">事項</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">事项；项目；事实</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216438\">ジェーンは<ruby>申込書<rp>(</rp><rt>もうしこみしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>必要<rp>(</rp><rt>ひつよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>事項<rp>(</rp><rt>じこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">詹姆斯在申请书中提交了要求。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">時刻</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じこく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">时刻；时间；有利时机；机会；良机</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204449\">そろそろ<ruby>寝<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>時刻<rp>(</rp><rt>じこく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">现在是睡觉的时候了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">時刻表</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じこくひょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">时刻表；时间表</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"150475\"><ruby>時刻表<rp>(</rp><rt>じこくひょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>改正<rp>(</rp><rt>かいせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">时间表已修改。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">地獄</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じごく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">地狱道；那落迦；（基督教）地狱；地狱；苦难；噩梦；火山或温泉不断喷出烟雾或蒸汽的地方</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"237349\"><ruby>最近<rp>(</rp><rt>さいきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、ローン<ruby>地獄<rp>(</rp><rt>じごく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>破産<rp>(</rp><rt>はさん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>増<rp>(</rp><rt>ふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">近来,在伦地狱里有越来越多的破产者。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">時差</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じさ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">时差</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">自殺</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じさつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">自杀</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">持参</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じさん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">携带；带来；拿来</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"196152\">ほとんどの<ruby>観光客<rp>(</rp><rt>かんこうきゃく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がカメラを<ruby>持参<rp>(</rp><rt>じさん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">大多数游客都带着相机。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">自在</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じざい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">随心所欲；任意；自由自在；自在钩；锅钩</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">磁石</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じしゃく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">磁铁；磁体；罗盘；指南针</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226070\">キートンはハトの<ruby>頭<rp>(</rp><rt>あたま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>磁石<rp>(</rp><rt>じしゃく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>付<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">基顿把磁石放在狐狸头上。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">自主</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じしゅ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">独立；自主；自力更生</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">自首</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じしゅ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">自首；投案自首；向当局自首</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207163\">その<ruby>犯人<rp>(</rp><rt>はんにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>警察<rp>(</rp><rt>けいさつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>自首<rp>(</rp><rt>じしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">凶手向警方投降。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">自習</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じしゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">自学；自修；自习；（老师不在时）自行学习</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">辞書</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じしょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">字典；词典；辞典；辞职信；辞呈</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205423\">それはどの<ruby>辞書<rp>(</rp><rt>じしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にもでています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">它在任何词典中都存在。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">辞職</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じしょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">辞职；辞去职务</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"156183\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>辞職<rp>(</rp><rt>じしょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>意志<rp>(</rp><rt>いし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまったくない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我一点也没有要辞职的意思。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/461610\"